            "bg_block": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "star": "5.0",
            "author": "Apple Cider Vinegar Gummies 🍏",
            "quote": "\"These ACV gummies are a game-changer! No more dealing with the harsh taste of liquid apple cider vinegar—just a delicious, slightly tangy chew that makes digestion and bloating so much better. I’ve noticed a real difference in my energy levels and metabolism after just a few weeks. Plus, they don’t upset my stomach like some ACV products do. Highly recommend!\"",
