            "bg_block": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "star": "4.5",
            "author": "Daily Multivitamin 💊",
            "quote": "\"This multivitamin covers all the basics and more. I love that it includes essential vitamins and minerals without unnecessary fillers. I feel a noticeable boost in my immune system, and my skin has been glowing since I started taking these. The only reason I’m giving 4.5 stars instead of 5 is that the tablets are a little big—but totally worth it for the benefits!\"",
            "author_info": "Jonny Jr",
            "inverted": false
          }
        },
        "template--14582219472960__ec07dc0f-81a1-4a72-b8aa-d4b89a183c31-167644804082acf40e-1": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
