            "bg_block": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "star": "5.0",
            "author": "Clarity Mushroom Blend 🍄🧠",
            "quote": "\"Absolutely love this blend! I take it every morning, and my focus and mental clarity have improved significantly. It helps me stay sharp without the jittery feeling of coffee. The mix of Lion’s Mane, Cordyceps, and other mushrooms is perfect for productivity. If you need a brain boost, this is it!\"",
            "author_info": "Mary J",
            "inverted": false
          }
        },
        "template--14582219472960__ec07dc0f-81a1-4a72-b8aa-d4b89a183c31-167644804082acf40e-2": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
