            "bg_block": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "star": "4.7",
            "author": "Sleep Gummies 😴🌙",
            "quote": "\"These gummies are a lifesaver for my sleep routine! The melatonin and herbal blend help me fall asleep faster and wake up feeling refreshed, not groggy. Plus, they taste amazing—like a little bedtime treat. The only downside is that I wish the bottle had more!\"",
